    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong>·10月更新内容前瞻</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"308\" title=\"10月前瞻.png\" alt=\"10月前瞻.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20251010/c535e463cb652f69412826e7d74f63e6.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·游览者列表</span></strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"309\" title=\"10月小队.png\" alt=\"10月小队.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20251010/0c8787ffcd205cc5df7fce2c2fa6f060.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">界园游客 令</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">为这世间一醉又何妨？</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·游园纪念</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"310\" title=\"10月奖励.png\" alt=\"10月奖励.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20251010/684e0b16782e94713f726cc4149e12f8.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">游园纪念添加内容</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">游园纪念的等级上限提升至</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">95</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">10月稀有奖励 炎狱炎熔形象时装</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">仿佛只为表明自己的态度，炎熔向裁缝递上一张炎国侠士的参考图后，便不再过问作战服的设计细节。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">侠是一种风貌，一种境界——也是她的自我要求。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·本月委托栏</span></strong></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">本月委托栏将会覆盖一批委托。委托更新后，上月的委托进度将不会被继承。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">您将获得可在本月使用的四次刷新未完成委托的机会。点击刷新后，即可重新获得同等级的委托。</span></span></span></p>",
